      "notice": "SlipStream's release parser (`internal/release`) and the series Content Type's title and numbering rules (`internal/contenttypes/series`) are Go ports of Sonarr's C# parser, copyright the Sonarr contributors and modified for SlipStream. Their regular expressions are Sonarr's, copied as data into each package's `internal/upstream`, and each package's `upstream.json` maps its Go files to the Sonarr files they port. The parser's golden tests read Sonarr's parser test cases at the commit above, and the formats package ports Sonarr's Custom Format conditions and enums."
