      "notice": "The release parser reads HDR, video codec, audio codec and channels from a release name with the conditions of TRaSH Guides' Custom Formats, copied as data into `internal/release/internal/upstream`. The formats tests run every TRaSH Custom Format from a snapshot in `internal/formats/testdata/trash`."
    },
